    54→        on_fail: Update or create spec before proceeding
    55→      - type: decision
    56→        content: What is the spec status?
    57→        options:
    58→          - Spec exists and matches -> Derive task, proceed
    59→          - Spec exists but outdated -> Update spec first
    60→          - No spec exists -> Create spec first (behavior) or task directly (infra)
