   185→    type: friction
   186→    content: >-
   187→      ReferenceIndex Result<T> pattern gotcha: resolve() returns Result objects with .ok field, not
   188→      items directly. Must check result.ok before accessing result.item - TypeScript doesn't enforce
   189→      this at compile time. Pattern: if (result.ok) { use result.item } else { handle error }.
   190→      Encountered multiple times across iterations.
   191→    created_at: '2026-01-18T17:50:20.175Z'
   192→    author: '@claude'
   193→    resolved: false
