   196→    type: friction
   197→    content: >-
   198→      Linter/tooling auto-revert blocker: During ralph loop iterations, file changes were repeatedly
   199→      auto-reverted by linter/auto-save system. Code written and verified would disappear after
   200→      edits. Affected shadow.ts, index.ts, test files. Possible causes: aggressive format-on-save,
   201→      linter deleting code it doesn't understand, file watcher conflicts. Blocks implementation work
   202→      when it occurs.
   203→    created_at: '2026-01-18T17:50:21.120Z'
   204→    author: '@claude'
   205→    resolved: false
   206→    resolution: null
   207→  - _ulid: 01KF93NDYAX7CWP4QP7072AHMH
   208→    type: friction
   209→    content: >-
   210→      Ralph loop session state freshness: Multiple issues with stale state in automation loops. (1)
   211→      Iteration started on non-main branch from previous session. (2) Session context showed
   212→      already-completed task as ready because context generated before commits reflected. (3) Picked
   213→      completed work repeatedly. Solutions: generate context AFTER pulling latest, validate task is
   214→      actually pending before starting, checkpoint script should update .kspec before next
   215→      iteration.
