   221→    type: friction
   222→    content: >-
   223→      Subprocess spawning complexity: When promoting observations to tasks, initially tried spawning
   224→      npm/tsx subprocess which caused temp directory path issues in tests. Switched to direct API
   225→      calls (createTask/saveTask) which simplified implementation and avoided process overhead.
   226→      Pattern: prefer direct API over subprocess when both run in same codebase.
