   242→    type: friction
   243→    content: >-
   244→      Bash tool cd persistence: Commands run in same directory as previous command unless explicit
   245→      cd. Running 'cd .kspec && git status' left session in .kspec worktree. Need explicit 'cd
   246→      /path/to/main' to return. Can be confusing when working with shadow branch.
