   459→      well-structured SessionContext schema and existing loadSessionContext/saveSessionContext
   460→      functions. Pattern of supporting show/set/clear modes in single command is clean and
   461→      user-friendly. Auto-prepending @ to references maintains UX consistency. Context integration
