   493→    content: >-
   494→      JSON output helper pattern: output() provides clean separation between JSON and human-readable
   495→      modes. Used successfully: return observation object in JSON mode, success message for human
   496→      mode. Pattern: output(dataObject, () => humanFormatter()). Avoids duplicate/mixed output that
   497→      happens with separate success() + output() calls.
